@startuml
title Flow 1 - AI-assisted archival of a new physical score (Music librarian)

actor "Music librarian" as Lib
participant "SAM UI" as UI
participant "SAM Server" as Server
participant "LLM Provider" as LLM

Lib -> UI: scans score to PDF,\nuploads to staging area
UI -> Server: POST /api/documents
Server --> UI: document stored (unlinked)

Lib -> UI: clicks "Classify"
UI -> Server: POST /documents/{id}/classify
Server -> Server: extract text (PDFBox)
alt text extraction insufficient (scanned/image-only)
  Server -> LLM: vision fallback
  LLM --> Server: detected metadata
end
Server -> Server: match musicians/instruments\n(pg_trgm trigram similarity)
Server --> UI: SheetClassification
UI --> Lib: review form pre-filled

Lib -> UI: adjusts fields, confirms
UI -> Server: POST /documents/{id}/apply
Server -> Server: create/resolve Sheet,\ncreate Instrumentation,\nlink Attachment
Server --> UI: ClassificationApplyResult
UI --> Lib: sheet detail opens

Lib -> UI: opens instrumentation,\nenters physical location,\nsets condition = GOOD
UI -> Server: PUT /instrumentations/{id}
Server --> UI: saved
@enduml